    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I downloaded and uncompressed the RRO package from Revolutionanalytics. Running the following command inside the directory:<div><br></div><div>-------------------------------</div><div># dnf -y --nogpgcheck install RRO-3.2.1-el7.x86_64.rpm   </div><div>Last metadata expiration check performed 0:46:27 ago on Fri Aug 21 13:40:11 2015.</div><div>Error: nothing provides libicui18n.so.50()(64bit) needed by RRO-3.2.1-3.2.1-1.el7.centos.x86_64</div><div>(try to add &#39;--allowerasing&#39; to command line to replace conflicting packages)</div><div>----------------------------</div><div><br></div><div>The icu package is in fact installing<b> libicui18n.so.54</b>. Before I go further on the install, please tell me if it possible to use thi newer version of icu or shall I downgrade ?</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you for hint</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
